  "title": "Piedmont Natural Gas lowers rates, saving North Carolina residential customers $100 per year",
  "summary": "Piedmont Natural Gas today announced it has decreased rates for its North Carolina customers. Combined, Piedmont’s 2026 rate decreases are reducing average residential customers’ bills by approximately 8%, or about $100, per year.",
